cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use PROPACK, please cite the technical report below."
title: "PROPACK: Software for large and sparse SVD calculations"
abstract: >-
  PROPACK computes the singular value decomposition of large and sparse or
  structured matrices using Lanczos bidiagonalization with partial
  reorthogonalization (BPRO).
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Larsen
    given-names: Rasmus Munk
    email: rmlarsen@gmail.com
license: BSD-3-Clause
repository-code: "https://github.com/rmlarsen/propack"
url: "https://github.com/rmlarsen/propack"
keywords:
  - singular value decomposition
  - SVD
  - Lanczos bidiagonalization
  - partial reorthogonalization
  - sparse matrices
  - numerical linear algebra
preferred-citation:
